Aggregator ->
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-> This is a message routing step that combines multiple messages into a single message based on a correlation condition
you can use aggregator in scenarios where you need to collect and merge messages that belong to the same logic
group of sequences.
You want to combine related individual messages so that they can be processed in bulk. Using an Aggregator
pattern, you can collect and store individual messages until a complete set of related messages has been
received. The aggregated message is then sent to the actual receiver.

Use Case
You want to collect individual product items related to the same order. The aggregated items are to be sent
as one single order with multiple items.

-> it is not work in local integration process and exception subprocess
-> it will work with only XML data.
-> common thing like company
-> This data will store in data store
-> It is not store the duplicate items

